  Launcher3 draws the desk's wallpaper behind its windows in Overview (OpenBook Launcher, docs/launcher-design.md
  §5.2, ANAL-372). Reading the wallpaper needs READ_WALLPAPER_INTERNAL, which is signature|privileged, and
  Launcher3QuickStep is not platform-signed, so this entry grants it. Merged with AOSP's own com.android.launcher3.xml.
-->
<permissions>
    <privapp-permissions package="com.android.launcher3">
        <permission name="android.permission.READ_WALLPAPER_INTERNAL" />
    </privapp-permissions>
</permissions>
